<!-- buttondown-editor-mode: fancy --><h3>The reasons</h3><p>I often find cool things online like resources, websites and so on. Thus, I would like to share them somewhere somehow.</p><p><strong>Moreover,</strong> I am also eager to share stuff about my life as small updates and preserve them here. So, this newsletter is meant to fulfill that purpose.</p><p>More stuff I will figure out as I go but so far i find the format promising and more focused than posting on social media.</p><p>All these emails will be saved on my <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://tpdkr.github.io/cv_page2/">website</a>, where you can find them under <strong>“Newsletter”</strong> section.</p>`,Ub=`---
